#+TITLE: org-llm — agent avatar themes (literate config)
#+AUTHOR: you
#+OPTIONS: toc:nil num:nil
#+FILETAGS: :org-llm:themes:avatars:

# Copy to ~/org/org-llm-themes.org to enable. The proxy + avatar
# generator auto-loads it (mtime-cached); add/edit themes without a
# relaunch. Default theme is `trek` if no theme is named on
# `org-llm config avatar_theme <name>`.
#
# Schema (see § Design notes at the end for full details):
#
#   * <theme-name>                                                :theme:
#   :PROPERTIES:
#   :NAME:             <unique theme id>
#   :MODE:             character_map | archetypal_generation
#   :STYLE_TAGS:       comma-separated aesthetic tags
#   :PROMPT_TEMPLATE:  prompt skeleton with {placeholders}
#   :BACKEND_HINT:     together | replicate | local | dalle  (optional)
#   :END:
#
# Then per-character or per-archetype headings:
#
#   ** <name>                                        :character: | :archetype:
#   :PROPERTIES:
#   :FEATURES:  feature description used in prompts
#   :END:
#
# Per-agent assignment lives in agents' own metadata (see
# ~/org/org-llm-agents.org § visual.default_seed). The theme controls
# the AESTHETIC; the agent's seed picks WHICH character/archetype.
#
# Trademark note: theme prompts describe FEATURES, not name-tokens.
# "Vulcan with pointed ears, bowl cut, blue uniform" produces stable
# Spock-shaped output across SDXL/FLUX/DALL-E without invoking
# trademarks that get filtered or hallucinated inconsistently.


* trek                                                            :theme:
:PROPERTIES:
:NAME:             trek
:MODE:             character_map
:STYLE_TAGS:       1990s sci-fi headshot, photorealistic portrait, neutral plain backdrop, soft studio lighting, professional Starfleet personnel file aesthetic, sharp focus, three-quarter view from shoulders up
:PROMPT_TEMPLATE:  Professional headshot portrait. {features}. {expression}. {style_tags}.
:BACKEND_HINT:     together
:END:

# ── TNG bridge crew ──────────────────────────────────────────────────

** picard                                                     :character:
:PROPERTIES:
:NAME:       picard
:AGENT:      crew
:FEATURES:   Bald middle-aged human captain, narrow oval face, fair complexion, calm authoritative expression, burgundy red Starfleet command uniform with black yoke shoulders and four gold rank pips on collar
:EXPRESSION: composed, decisive, slight gravity in the brow
:END:

** data                                                       :character:
:PROPERTIES:
:NAME:       data
:AGENT:      gardener
:FEATURES:   Pale-yellow android complexion with subtle metallic sheen, golden contact-lens-style eyes, jet-black hair in a precise side-parted style, mustard gold Starfleet operations uniform with black yoke shoulders
:EXPRESSION: neutral curious, head slightly tilted, methodical attention
:END:

